														I have recently been really going gung-ho in my alchemy practicing.  I'm at the point right now where i'm making sow potions fairly easily, and now i'm making the invis vs undead and damage shield ones.  So far i've sold quite a few 10charge sow potions, at 100pp each.  What i would like to know is if that sounds bout right for my price, or should i up it to 120pp?  And what prices should i charge for the other 2?  160, 180, 200?  Just looking for suggestions.  Thanx fellas!						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
