					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Not sure about the others, but SoW potions generally go for 120pp firm.<br />
<br />
If you need a customer, I'd like to place an order.<br />
<br />
I need:<br />
2 10-charge SoW potions<br />
1 10-charge Invis/undead potion<br />
2 10-charge damage shield potions<br />
<br />
Let me know how much I'll owe you.<br />
<br />
Thanks,<br />
Bonestriker.						</td>
